      "description": "A better Instagram reels search: type any word, phrase, product or creator name and get the reels that match, sorted newest first, each with its publish date, caption snippet, author and cover image. Instagram's own reel search won't let you search by what was said in a reel, and it won't sort by date - this reels finder does both, which is how you find that reel you saw but didn't save.",
